flush table inet remnawave_hopping
add chain inet remnawave_hopping prerouting { type nat hook prerouting priority dstnat; policy accept; }
add chain inet remnawave_hopping output { type nat hook output priority dstnat; policy accept; }
add rule inet remnawave_hopping prerouting udp dport 20000-20019 redirect to :32001 comment "route-test-a"
add rule inet remnawave_hopping output ip daddr 127.0.0.0/8 udp dport 20000-20019 redirect to :32001 comment "route-test-a"
